{"run_id": "c726f447166d4028b21459609c5f7b0c", "sequence": 4, "time": "2026-10-29T16:40:18.589377+00:00", "event": "tool_result", "call_id": "p01-1-0", "name": "search_documents", "observation": {"ok": true, "mode": "hybrid", "hits": [{"doc_id": "D03", "version_date": "2026-02-01", "chunk_id": "c001", "title": "年假申请流程", "topic": "年假", "scope": "全体正式员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r001", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["年假申请流程", "正文"], "token_count": 60, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D03-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/markdown/D03_年假申请流程.md", "sha256": "041edf691e47cbcdc69171f784c112374b5b1f13fb3cb87501fd6c1b0c7e36be", "method": "markdown", "page": null, "bbox": null, "line_start": 13, "line_end": 13, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "正式员工申请年假，应至少提前3个工作日在办公系统提交申请，并由直属主管审批。", "rrf_score": 0.032522, "bm25_score": 11.15199, "vector_score": 0.577552}, {"doc_id": "D03", "version_date": "2026-02-01", "chunk_id": "c002", "title": "年假申请流程", "topic": "年假", "scope": "全体正式员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r002", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["年假申请流程", "正文"], "token_count": 59, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D03-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/markdown/D03_年假申请流程.md", "sha256": "041edf691e47cbcdc69171f784c112374b5b1f13fb3cb87501fd6c1b0c7e36be", "method": "markdown", "page": null, "bbox": null, "line_start": 15, "line_end": 15, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "紧急请假可先联系主管，再于返岗后1个工作日内补交申请。本文不规定年假天数。", "rrf_score": 0.032522, "bm25_score": 6.021429, "vector_score": 0.586006}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c005", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r005", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第五条提交期限"], "token_count": 212, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.646304321289065, 182.91431884765626, 135.7866455078125, 196.494970703125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9998433079038348}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.646304321289065, 211.3488037109375, 541.8775390625, 240.6320556640625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.998851158789226}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [49.06931762695312, 254.637109375, 542.300537109375, 285.1935546875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9989627904362148}], "snippet": "第五条提交期限\n\n报销期限为费用发生后15个自然日。本文未说明适用部门，也未说明是否替代其他报销制度。自然日包括周末和节假日，申请人不应自行改为工作日口径。申请材料应如实列明费用发生日期及提交日期。\n\n本资料未定义首日是否计入、截止时刻以及节假日顺延。若用户要求计算精确的最迟提交日，应先确认这些口径；本文只能支持“费用发生后15个自然日”的原则性表述，不能支", "rrf_score": 0.015873, "bm25_score": 4.414967, "vector_score": 0.409842}, {"doc_id": "D01", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c004", "title": "费用报销制度甲", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r004", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度甲", "第四条 不同材料之间的关系"], "token_count": 144, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 600.1171875, 191.75, 611.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 626.9765625, 541.5, 672.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第四条 不同材料之间的关系\n\n费用报销提交期限、费用金额标准和支付处理时间属于不同事项。住宿限额应查阅住宿制度，不能用本制度的提交期限推算住宿额度；本文也不规定年假、工资、社保或税务处理方法。资料没有给出的事项，应补充相应制度再确认。", "rrf_score": 0.015625, "bm25_score": 3.500545, "vector_score": 0.350689}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c002", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r002", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第二条费用单据组成"], "token_count": 236, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 1, "bbox": [47.80028381347656, 306.8377197265625, 156.0911865234375, 318.29638671875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.999133739206526}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.646304321289065, 331.45263671875, 541.454541015625, 379.4093017578125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9991200426791577}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 1, "bbox": [47.80028381347656, 392.5655517578125, 541.031494140625, 442.219775390625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9990601209883995}], "snippet": "第二条费用单据组成\n\n一项完整申请应包括费用说明、对应发票、实际支付材料和必要的业务审批记录。申请人应说明费用何时发生、用于何项工作、由谁支付以及由哪个项目承担。多人共同产生费用时，应列明参与关系，避免同一笔支出在多个申请中出现。\n\n发票用于说明交易项目与金额，支付材料用于证明实际付款过程，业务说明用于解释与工作的关系。三者作用不同，不能因为已有其中一项便默", "rrf_score": 0.015385, "bm25_score": 3.448387, "vector_score": 0.246879}, {"doc_id": "D09", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c001", "title": "密码规则新版", "topic": "密码规则", "scope": "企业账号", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r001", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["密码规则新版", "正文"], "token_count": 71, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D09-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/markdown/D09_密码规则新版.md", "sha256": "71ad9ff23c2dcf6e540cf1d673187f2bb0977564ec21c1a7fd9402e6c00951e4", "method": "markdown", "page": null, "bbox": null, "line_start": 13, "line_end": 13, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "自2026年1月1日起，企业账号密码至少12位，每90天更换一次。本制度明确替代2025年1月1日发布的D08密码规则。", "rrf_score": 0.015152, "bm25_score": 3.315889, "vector_score": 0.384311}]}}
